        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 258-RDT, Uptown Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Kwikset Uptown Deadbolt is available in popular finish choices and has been designed not only to look great, but also to be easy to install. It will fit most pre-drilled doors. It is adjustable to fit doors 1-3/8 inches through 1-3/4 inches thick with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis <b>Smartkey</b> Kwikset Lock offers convenience and security. It allows you to re-key the lock yourself without removing from the door; this mean you will be able to key all your SmartKey locks to one Kwikset key. Smartkey Deadbolts offer the highest grade of  security with a standard ANSI/BHMA Grade 1 Cylinder. It is pick resistant and bump proof.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The Kwikset Uptown Deadbolt is thrown or retracted by key from the outside and by turn unit on the inside. It features a Kwikset SmartKey security lock cylinder and 1\" throw steel bolt. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/downtown-deadbolt-kwikset-258sqt\"><b>Kwikset 258SQT Square Downtown Deadbolt</b></a> \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Uptown Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>A fully adjustable latch & deadbolt to fit all standard door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A156.36 Grade 1 Security</li>\r\n<li>Meets ADA/ANSI A117.1 requirements, ensuring accessibility to all disabled persons</li>\r\n<li>Patented side locking bar technology offers improved security by protecting against lock bumping, an attack technique used to defeat conventional pin & tumbler locks.</li>\r\n<li>Kwikset SmartKey lock cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>ADA compliant interior turn piece.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime mechanical and finish warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Kwikset Uptown Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable  2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt: 1\" Throw Steel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
